ffmpeg-rockchip (6.1+git20260423.40c412dacc-0ubuntu1~rk1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Initial PPA package for nyanmisaka's FFmpeg 6.1 Rockchip fork.
  * Install as a co-installable private runtime under /opt/ffmpeg-rockchip
    with non-shadowing command names ffmpeg-rockchip, ffprobe-rockchip, and
    ffplay-rockchip.
  * Enable RKMPP/RKRGA support without replacing Ubuntu's system ffmpeg/libav*
    packages.

